  "reviewed_runtime_boundaries": [
    "All twelve frozen variants materialize through production EnemyDefinition, EnemyStat, EnemyPhase, EnemyAbility and AI graph rows.",
    "Every frozen encounter and difficulty level has a corresponding authored EnemyStat row.",
    "Damage ratios, elements, target patterns, weaknesses, resistances and toughness are transcribed from the committed version 4.4 extraction.",
    "Automaton Spider retains Timed Module, Self-Exploding Module and its killing-blow Chains of Destruction damage.",
    "Ballistarius retains six-hit random-target Mounted Crossbow.",
    "Shape Shifter retains its HP-consuming two-unit summon and Vigor Draining healing boundary.",
    "Decaying Shadow retains the Binding and Liberation sequence; Beyond Overcooked variants retain stove charge, ignition/detonation and party damage.",
    "The nine inherited approximate variants use the named normalized template curve while preserving executable source-ordered mechanics.",
    "No native handler is introduced."
